    "sources": [
      "https://codeinplace.stanford.edu/ (syllabus table embedded in the site's JS bundle: assets/default-CDCrfV2J.js; weekly titles also in assets/CourseRoutes-B09XBB48.js, retrieved 2026-10-12)",
      "https://codeinplace.stanford.edu/cip5/certificate/3cnzhc (2025 certificate: Apr 21 - Jun 6 2025; Units: Karel the Robot, Console Programming, Graphics/Lists/Dictionaries)",
      "https://github.com/mkrdip/codeinplace-2024 (CIP 2024 section leader materials: weekly section topics and section problems)",
      "https://github.com/Bassamejlaoui/Stanford-Code-In-Place-2024 (student repo, CIP 2024 Karel problems)",
